OL,3,AArtist defends 'unfinished' Ronnie
OL,4,AO'Sullivan mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Sheffield street artist has defended
OL,7,Fhis mural of snooker player Ronnie
OL,8,FO'Sullivan after the design received
OL,9,Fcriticism - saying that the project is
OL,10,F"unfinished".
OL,12,FChris Ashmore was commissioned to
OL,13,Fproduce the artwork featuring
OL,14,Fseven-time world champion O'Sullivan
OL,15,Ffor the back wall of the Spot On
OL,16,FSnooker Club on Langsett Road.
OL,18,FAlthough many residents said they liked
OL,19,Fthe mural, others described it as
OL,20,F"zombie-like", "shocking" and
OL,21,FO'Sullivan's face as "skeletal".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
