OL,3,AArtist defends 'unfinished' Ronnie
OL,4,AO'Sullivan mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FAshmore said he was surprised by the
OL,7,Fviral response online, but confirmed
OL,8,Fthat he had only completed two weeks
OL,9,Fout of the five assigned to the job,
OL,10,Fand "touch-ups" were still needed.
